   "text": "Prototype notes\n\n• Start at 1 · Welcome and press Play. Answers you give in the quiz (boy or girl, name, age, interests, colour) are saved in this browser and used on every screen.\n• World activities: pick any of the 480 and it opens in its own game type.\n• Every game records accuracy and speed; My progress and the parent dashboard read it.\n• Avi peeks on Kid home: first peek after ~6 s for the demo, then every 3–6 min.\n• Story pictures are drawn vector scenes; the real app swaps in AI paintings."
